{"id":"442547","name":"年糕鱼丸菠菜汤","author":"我叫一尾鱼","authorId":"9320028","desc":"","cover":"images/442547/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"5根"},{"name":"鱼丸","amount":"5个"},{"name":"年糕","amount":"1条"},{"name":"裙带菜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"3克"},{"name":"香油","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜去要切成小段备用。","img":"images/442547/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"年糕切成薄片备用。","img":"images/442547/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅热油放入葱花炒香。","img":"images/442547/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加盐、开水、裙带菜和虾皮大火烧开。","img":"images/442547/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入年糕和鱼丸烧开。","img":"images/442547/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入菠菜，淋入几滴香油即可。","img":"images/442547/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/442547/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}